WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.320
Many of us have tumors growing
inside of us right now.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.120
While most people
develop cancer,

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:12.400
slowing its growth can help us
unknowingly live with it

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.840
rather than die from it.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.868
Watch the video
to learn more.

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:23.980
"How to Slow Cancer Growth"

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.480
One cancer cell
never hurt anyone.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.160
Two cancer cells
never hurt anyone.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.040
But a billion cancer cells?

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.560
That's when we start
getting into trouble.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.720
So, we have to slow,
even reverse,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.240
the division and growth
of cancer cells.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.080
We all have cells
that could grow into tumors,

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.760
but if we slow them down,

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.080
our immune systems
may have a chance

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.280
to clean them up
before they hurt us.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.320
Take breast cancer,
for example,

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.400
the most common internal cancer
among American women.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.720
Like all cancers,
it starts with a single cell.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.440
This is a photomicrograph

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.280
(a photograph
taken under a microscope)

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.760
of an actual
breast cancer cell

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.040
which then divides
and becomes two cells,

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.120
then four, then eight,
and so on.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.600
Every time the cells divide,

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.240
the tiny tumor
doubles in size.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.800
It only needs to double
about 30 times,

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.400
and we're up to
a billion cancer cells,

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.840
which is a tumor
just large enough

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.680
to be felt and picked up
by mammography.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:25.360
Even though a tumor
only has to double 30 times,

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.480
it may take anywhere

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:29.920
from about 50 days
to a thousand days

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:32.480
for a cancer cell
to double just once.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.440
So, that means from the time
that first cell mutates,

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.720
it takes between a few years
and nearly a century

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:41.560
before it grows to show up
as a little tumor we can see.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.920
The shortest known interval

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.600
between exposure to a carcinogen
and the development of cancer

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.480
is about 18 months,

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.480
which is when
some of the first leukemia cases

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.080
started appearing
after Hiroshima.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.280
Cancers need time to grow,
and for most solid tumors,

00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:00.560
meaning non-blood tumors,
cancer takes decades to develop.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:01.400
Check it out:

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.880
the ovarian cancer
you get diagnosed with

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.240
at the average age of 62

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.760
started growing
44 years earlier.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:13.400
So, you've had cancer
since you were 18 years old,

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.400
you just didn't know it.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.800
Some breast cancers
may even start in the womb

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:18.880
before we're even born,

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.000
and may depend in part
on what your mom ate.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.920
The process
of cancer development

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.720
happens in stages.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.200
The first stage of cancer
is cancer initiation,

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:33.000
the irreversible DNA mutation
that turns that first cell bad.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.680
But then we move to
the promotion stage of cancer,

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:38.120
which is reversible.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.560
If we don't promote
the tumor growth

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.680
it can stay hidden forever
or even disappear.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.400
When I was a teen
I ate a lot of processed meat,

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.680
bacon, hot dogs,

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.840
known human carcinogens,
meaning they cause cancer.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.560
I very well may have mutated
one of the cells in my colon.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.680
It can take 50 years
for colon cancer to show up

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.840
after it's been initiated.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.360
Cancer may have been initiated
by a DNA mutation,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.480
but if we don't promote it,

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.840
if we keep it dormant,

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:06.880
if we slow it down,

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.440
we may be able to even reverse
its growth.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.640
I mean, I don't care
if the cancer shows up

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.680
a hundred years from now.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.800
I don't imagine I'll be around
to worry about it.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.640
Take prostate cancer.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.120
More men die
with prostate cancer

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.000
than because of it.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.800
According to autopsy studies
in Japan,

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.720
there is about as much
hidden prostate cancer there

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.920
as we have in the United States.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.800
But their risk of dying
from prostate cancer

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:35.840
was 40 times lower,

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.000
until they started
westernizing their diets

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.720
and started eating more like us,

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.760
with more animal foods,
fewer plants.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.920
Japan has among
the longest life expectancies,

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.600
but when Japanese men
finally do die,

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.800
many have tiny prostate tumors.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.520
But they die with their cancer,
instead of from their cancer.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.600
By their 60s,
the majority of men,

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.800
nearly two-thirds,

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.720
have tiny
prostate cancer tumors

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:02.040
whether they know it or not,

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.480
and nearly one in three men
in their thirties

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.760
is already brewing cancer
in their prostates.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.240
Similarly, if you look
at forensic autopsies

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.800
of middle-aged women,

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:14.120
more than a third
were already harboring cancer

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.040
in their breast when they were
only in their 40s.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.440
Yet the risk of dying
from breast cancer at that age

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.800
is less than one percent.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.280
In fact, your cumulative risk
of ever dying from breast cancer

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.760
in your lifetime
is less than four percent.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:30.280
So, most breast cancers,
just like most prostate cancers,

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:33.480
grow so slowly that
you can live your whole life

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.320
not even knowing
you have them.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.520
It's like atherosclerosis.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.120
About half of young Americans

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.040
already have
atherosclerotic plaques,

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.600
hardening
of their coronary arteries,

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.000
by their twenties.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:48.000
So, what we think of as diet
and lifestyle prevention

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.480
for both
of our leading killers,

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.840
heart disease and cancer,

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:55.440
may actually be diet
and lifestyle treatment.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.720
At this very moment,

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:59.120
many of us have tumors
growing inside of us;

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:02.280
so, we can't wait until later
to start eating healthier.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.400
We have to start now.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.440
How can we slow down
and even reverse cancer

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.400
while it's still microscopic?

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.200
Well, for prostate
and breast cancers,

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.600
those tissues
tend to be sensitive

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.280
to growth-promoting hormones.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.280
Scientists from UCLA placed
women on a plant-based diet

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.560
with exercise,

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.000
and found that the levels
of all measured growth hormones

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.840
in their blood
dropped dramatically

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.920
within just two weeks.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.800
What would that do to cancer?

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.720
The researchers
drew the women's blood

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.440
before and after
those two weeks

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.320
and dripped them onto three
types of breast cancer cells

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.000
growing in petri dishes.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.680
Here's the before,

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.480
cancer growth powering away
at 100 percent;

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.400
and here's the after.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.880
After just two weeks of eating
healthfully and walking,

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.560
the blood of women
on the plant-based diet

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.880
reduced their cancer growth
rates by 12 percent.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.120
And cancer cell death,
apoptosis,

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.160
shot up by 24 percent.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.360
After just two weeks
of moving on a plant-based diet,

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.800
the blood circulating
throughout their entire bodies

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.480
was that much more
inhospitable to cancer.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.040
At this very moment,

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.320
many of us have tumors
growing inside of us,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.040
so we can't wait
until we're older

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.680
to start eating
and living healthier.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:15.000
We have to start now...tonight.

